{
  "$schema": "https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json",
  "name": "john",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/JohnC0de/registry",
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "type": "registry:item",
      "title": "Server env",
      "description": "Zod-validated getServerEnv() (DATABASE_URL, BETTER_AUTH_SECRET, BETTER_AUTH_URL plus optional DATABASE_POOL_SIZE and DB_*_MS / DB_APPLICATION_NAME). Secrets are Secret values that print as [redacted] in strings, JSON and console output; read them with .reveal(). Validation errors name the key, never the value. Parsed on first use, so vite build needs no secrets.",
      "dependencies": [
        "zod"
      ],
      "envVars": {
        "DATABASE_URL": "postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/app",
        "BETTER_AUTH_SECRET": "change-me",
        "BETTER_AUTH_URL": "http://localhost:3000"
      },
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "registry/env/src/env.ts",
          "type": "registry:file",
          "target": "~/src/env.ts"
        },
        {
          "path": "registry/env/src/env.test.ts",
          "type": "registry:file",
          "target": "~/src/env.test.ts"
        },
        {
          "path": "registry/env/.agents/env.md",
          "type": "registry:file",
          "target": "~/.agents/env.md"
        }
      ],
      "devDependencies": [
        "@types/bun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "db",
      "type": "registry:item",
      "title": "Drizzle + Postgres",
      "description": "Cached drizzle client (getDb) with pool size, statement_timeout, lock_timeout, idle_in_transaction_session_timeout and application_name read from env; shared timestamp columns; drizzle.config.ts (schema/*.ts); scripts/migrate.ts; a production migration guard (scripts/migrate-production.ts: needs --production-url, refuses DATABASE_URL, dry listing unless --yes); and a local Postgres docker-compose.yml. package.json scripts cannot ship; add them: { \"db:start\": \"docker compose up -d\", \"db:generate\": \"drizzle-kit generate\", \"db:migrate\": \"bun run scripts/migrate.ts\", \"db:migrate:production\": \"bun run scripts/migrate-production.ts\", \"db:studio\": \"drizzle-kit studio\" }. Then run db:start, db:generate and db:migrate.",
      "dependencies": [
        "drizzle-orm",
        "postgres",
        "zod"
      ],
      "devDependencies": [
        "drizzle-kit",
        "@types/bun"
      ],
