    {
      "name": "docker",
      "type": "registry:item",
      "title": "Production Dockerfile (bun)",
      "description": "Multi-stage Dockerfile for a vite-built TanStack Start app on Bun, serve.ts (serves dist/client statics in front of dist/server/server.js), .dockerignore, and docker-compose.coolify.yml: the app plus a one-shot migrate service (same image, runs scripts/migrate.ts; the app waits for it). Requires bun.lock, a committed src/routeTree.gen.ts and a committed drizzle/. Secrets are runtime variables, never build args. Healthcheck uses /api/health from @john/health.",
