    {
      "name": "guards",
      "type": "registry:item",
      "title": "Build and dependency guards",
      "description": "scripts/build-check.ts builds with a canary in every non-VITE_ key from .env.example, scans dist/client for it and fails when the build changes a tracked src/routeTree.gen.ts. src/deps.test.ts fails when bun.lock holds two @tanstack/router-core versions or @tanstack/start-server-core is below 1.169.39 (CVE-2026-102989). package.json scripts cannot ship; add: { \"test\": \"bun test --pass-with-no-tests\", \"build:check\": \"bun scripts/build-check.ts\" } and run build:check inside check.",
